# Links for the Super+B menu (archype-vicinae-ext), opened in Brave. Copied once; edit freely.
#
# One link per line: [name] url [container] [mode]
#   name       optional, may have spaces (but no "." or "://"); without it the menu shows the address
#   container  a Brave container's name, "temp" for a new temporary container, "-" for none (default)
#   mode       tab (default), window (new window) or app (borderless; ignores the container for now)
#
# Examples:
#   Mail     mail.google.com   Personal
#   Work     github.com        Work       window
#   Try it   example.com       temp

GitHub      github.com
YouTube     youtube.com
